の話は、彼女の前ではタブーである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属している剣道部の縁から、沙希とは知り合い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19989","sourceWorkId":"9222","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"海晴坂中央学园中的女孩子。语气很强硬，但在主人公面前也会表现出乖巧的一面，被哥哥指出就会生气。而且，增长不足的部分（身长＆胸）被提到就会发怒。是学校剑道部的成员。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11981"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"aa","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19989","sourceWorkId":"9222","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"146 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19989","sourceWorkId":"9222","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/1338fc969c0ea12da89c2e9d6da0cb543cb8d87c793580eb9bf440c9c993120d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a63ea1ee7d77cedd0f5cff4be5dfacd73142a19087c83cb4b5fec9da020cbbb6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"成瀬未亜","creatorId":"vndb:s470","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s470","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s470","name":"成瀬 未亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:12569:11981:4810:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c652","characterName":"山吹 美幸","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11982","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12569"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19990"],"vndbCharacterId":"c652"},"originalCharacterName":"山吹 美幸","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"218"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The class president in Masato's class. She is very fond of her mother and comes to visit her in the hospital every day. Doesn't get along with her dad."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c652"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"蒼南学園に通う2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温和で真面目な性格から、クラス委員長を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛関係はこの上なく苦手で、相手を意識すると、耳まで真っ赤になってしまうほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病を抱えた母を、心から慕っている優しい少女である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19990","sourceWorkId":"9222","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"苍南学园中的女孩子。在学校担任学籍委员长，温和的性格在男生女生中都很有人气。听到朋友谈起恋爱的话题（主要是肉体关系）的话，连耳根都会变的通红。衷心的爱慕着生病着的母亲。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11982"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19990","sourceWorkId":"9222","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19990","sourceWorkId":"9222","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fefc51607cd27fcd2f5787b0d74aa6c1f6f7b38f0b6ddff55516cbc315ac8376.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e47207a75c66a07fe147e5655fb790aba756ff8254878fa89c6f37605f19984.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:12569:11982:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c653","characterName":"姫萩 はるな","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11983","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12569"}],"egsCharacterIds"